guarantee: AC: a stale tmp from a crash never turns the transcript/meta write into storage failure (write_atomic opens its tmp with File::create)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/storage.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
    let file = File::create(&tmp)?;
    fill_and_rename(file, &tmp, &target, bytes)
--- new
    let file = File::create_new(&tmp)?;
    fill_and_rename(file, &tmp, &target, bytes)
--- end
